```mermaid
graph TD
    User((User)) -->|HTTPS| CF[CloudFront Edge Location]
    
    CF -->|Cache Hit| User
    
    CF -->|Cache Miss: /api/*| ALB[Application Load Balancer]
    CF -->|Cache Miss: /*| S3[Amazon S3 Bucket]
    
    ALB --> EC2[EC2 Backend]
    
    subgraph Security
        WAF[AWS WAF] -.->|Inspects| CF
        OAC[Origin Access Control] -.->|Secures| S3
    end
```
